<http://data.silknow.org/object/7a9fbd28-f271-39fd-936f-29fdb459729b>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Panel, made of part of a petticoat. Rectangular panel of quilted white cotton. Upper two-thirds quilted in herringbone pattern; lower third patterned with swirling spirals; zig-zag band between. Lower third embroidered with fine twisted polychrome woolen yarns. Symmetrical pattern of fine blossoms and tendrils arranged in vertical rows connected at bottom of fine swags. Below. A narrow border showing an undulating floral vine. A few small brown stains; wools worn in places, especially lower border."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/215c1d99-3280-35d1-8ac8-0908dfb0ce99> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Panel, made of part of a petticoat. Rectangular panel of quilted white cotton. Upper two-thirds quilted in herringbone pattern; lower third patterned with swirling spirals; zig-zag band between. Lower third embroidered with fine twisted polychrome woolen yarns. Symmetrical pattern of fine blossoms and tendrils arranged in vertical rows connected at bottom of fine swags. Below. A narrow border showing an undulating floral vine. A few small brown stains; wools worn in places, especially lower border."@en ;
